    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0533" n="499" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg499"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr.
                            Woodford.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If not already done, submit at once evidence Sartorius claim, referred to in my
                    752, August 25.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
